@description Vocaligner native analyzers (C++)
@author ErrrikMarrrtinez
@version 1.0.0
@about
  Optional C++ extension for Ruin Vocals (Vocaligner): parallel Classic Align and fast Pitch analysis.
  Ruin Vocals works without it (Lua / EEL engines); with it installed the C++ engines are used by default.
  Restart REAPER after installing or updating this package.
@changelog
  Classic Align engine (parallel features, matching and planning) and the Pitch analyzer in one extension; macOS (Apple Silicon and Intel) builds added
@provides
  [win64] reaper_vocaligner_native.dll
  [darwin-arm64] reaper_vocaligner_native-arm64.dylib
  [darwin64] reaper_vocaligner_native-x86_64.dylib
